<title>USA: Orbotech withdraws 2.5 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Orbotech withdraws 2.5 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Orbotech Ltd said on Thursday it had withdrawn its registration statement filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed public offering of 2.5 million ordinary shares.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it had announced recently that it chose to postpone the offering due to market conditions.</p>
<p>The decision to withdraw the offering at this time was made with the concurrence of the underwriters announced for the offering: Lehman Brothers Inc, Robertson, Stephens &amp; Company LLC and Montgomery Securities.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
